{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:37:50+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-23T06:37:50+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Emmi AG","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Packaged Foods","country":"Switzerland","city":"Lucerne","website":"https://group.emmi.com","employees":12831,"summary":"Emmi AG, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures and sells dairy products in Switzerland, North and South America, the rest of Europe, Africa, and the Asia Pacific. The company offers dairy products comprising milk, cream, and butter; cheese, including raclette and fondue; fresh products consisting of yogurts, yogurt drinks, kefir products, and desserts; fresh cheese, which consists of mozzarella, protein-rich cottage cheese, goat's milk fresh cheese, and goat's cheese curds; powders and concentrates, including milk powder; and other products and services, such as ready-to-drink coffee and trading business. It sells its products under the Emmi Caffè Latte, Gerber, Emmi Energy Milk High Protein, Kaltbach, Emmi Jogurt Pur, Emmi High Protein Water, Aktifit, Luzerner, Emmi Benecol, Emmi Good Day, Le petit chevrier, Emmi Raclette, Tonis mozzarella, Pierrot Ice Cream, and beleaf brands. The company also exports its products. The company was founded in 1907 and is headquartered in Lucerne, Switzerland. Emmi AG is a subsidiary of ZMP Invest AG.","exchange":"Swiss","currency":"CHF","financial_currency":"CHF","summary_fr":"Emmi AG, avec ses filiales, fabrique et vend des produits laitiers en Suisse, en Amérique du Nord et du Sud, dans le reste de l’Europe, en Afrique et en Asie-Pacifique. La société propose des produits laitiers comprenant du lait, de la crème et du beurre; du fromage, y compris la raclette et la fondue; des produits frais composés de yogourts, de boissons au yogourt, de produits au kéfir et de desserts; du fromage frais, composé de mozzarella, de fromage cottage riche en protéines, de fromage frais au lait de chèvre et de caillé de fromage de chèvre; des poudres. Elle vend ses produits sous les marques Emmi Caffè Latte, Gerber, Emmi Energy Milk High Protein, Kaltbach, Emmi Jogurt Pur, Emmi High Protein Water, Aktifit, Luzerner, Emmi Benecol, Emmi Good Day, Le petit chevrier, Emmi Raclette, Tonis Mozzarella, Pierrot Ice Cream et beleaf.","summary_fr_excerpt":true},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":4921825280,"shares_outstanding":5349810,"trailing_pe":21.550714,"forward_pe":18.988169,"price_to_book":4.4949093,"ev_to_ebitda":12.103,"ev_to_revenue":1.243,"dividend_yield":0.019,"payout_ratio":0.4059,"beta_yahoo":0.308},"targets":{"current_price":920.0,"mean":963.6667,"median":965.0,"high":1042.0,"low":830.0,"n_analysts":6,"reco_mean":null,"reco_key":"none"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-08-19"],"eps_avg":null,"eps_low":null,"eps_high":null,"revenue_avg":null,"ex_dividend":"2026-04-13","dividend_date":"2025-04-16"},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.53359,"institutions_pct":0.18100001,"institutions_float_pct":0.38807,"institutions_n":127,"institutions":[{"name":"Private Ocean, LLC","pct":0.0,"shares":67,"value":61640,"date":"2022-09-30","chg":0.0}],"funds":[{"name":"SmallCap World Fund Inc","pct":0.0109,"shares":58129,"value":53478680,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":-0.13159999},{"name":"American Century ETF Trust-Avantis International Small Cap Value ETF","pct":0.0087,"shares":46521,"value":42799320,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.026700001},{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.006,"shares":31981,"value":29422520,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.0044},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0039,"shares":20677,"value":19022840,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0153},{"name":"iShares Trust-iShares Core MSCI EAFE ETF","pct":0.0031,"shares":16411,"value":15098120,"date":"2026-08-31","chg":0.0053},{"name":"DFA INVESTMENT TRUST CO-The Continental Small Company Serie